    "final_answer": "I have all the information needed. Let me provide my findings.\n\n## Findings: AirPods on Apple\n\nI navigated to the AirPods page on apple.com and found the following information about the AirPods types currently available.\n\n### Three Main AirPods Product Lines (as shown in the navigation):\n1. **AirPods** (new - AirPods 5 generation)\n2. **AirPods Pro** (AirPods Pro 3 generation)\n3. **AirPods Max** (AirPods Max 2 generation)\n\n### Four Specific Models Currently Available (from the \"Compare AirPods models\" section):\n| # | Model | Price | Notes |\n|---|-------|-------|-------|\n| 1 | **AirPods 5** | $129 | New – Active Noise Cancellation, Force sensor |\n| 2 | **AirPods 5 Wireless Charging Case** | $149 | New – Adds wireless charging case, volume swipe, 5-hour battery |\n| 3 | **AirPods Pro 3** | $249 | Heart rate sensing, Hearing Aid feature, Hearing Protection |\n| 4 | **AirPods Max 2** | $549 | Over-ear, Digital Crown, 20-hour battery |\n\n### Answer:\n- **3 main product types/families** (AirPods, AirPods Pro, AirPods Max)\n- **4 specific models** currently offered for sale on apple.com (AirPods 5, AirPods 5 Wireless Charging Case, AirPods Pro 3, and AirPods Max 2)\n\nAll products are also marketed as supporting new features like Live Translation and Siri AI, with the AirPods 5 generation being new.",
